# NestJS API (GNO)

## Module shape

```
<feature>/
  <feature>.module.ts
  <feature>.controller.ts   # routes only
  <feature>.service.ts
  dto/*.dto.ts
  types.ts                  # domain + DEFAULT_* constants
  rules.ts                  # optional pure logic
  __tests__/
```

Internal modules (no HTTP): export `XxxService` only; keep `XxxRepository` unexported.

## DTOs

- One request family per file under `dto/`.
- Use `class-validator` + `class-transformer` (`@Type` for nested).
- Global pipe: `whitelist`, `transform`, `forbidNonWhitelisted`.

## Layering

- Controller → Service → Repository or internal data Service.
- Do not inject another feature’s repository across module boundaries; go through its exported service.
- Supabase access only in repositories (or supabase module client).

## Errors

- Invalid client input → `BadRequestException`.
- DB/unavailable → `ServiceUnavailableException` (or equivalent) from repository/service.
